{
  "duration": 53.62,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "When the talk ends, don't join the queue for the speaker.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.58,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Turn to the person sitting next to you.",
      "start": 3.26,
      "end": 4.82,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Thirty people rush the stage.",
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 6.82,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "You get forty seconds and a handshake.",
      "start": 7.4,
      "end": 9.02,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "By the parking lot, he's forgotten your face.",
      "start": 10.08,
      "end": 12.72,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "But look who's still in her seat.",
      "start": 13.58,
      "end": 14.8,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Say her name's Nia.",
      "start": 15.5,
      "end": 16.22,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "Notebook open.",
      "start": 16.94,
      "end": 17.3,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "She heard everything you heard.",
      "start": 18.08,
      "end": 19.52,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "So you've already got something to talk about.",
      "start": 19.96,
      "end": 21.54,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Ask, what's the one thing you're actually going to use?",
      "start": 22.02,
      "end": 24.88,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Now you're comparing notes, not making small talk.",
      "start": 25.46,
      "end": 27.96,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "You're thinking, but I came here to meet the speaker.",
      "start": 28.44,
      "end": 29.98,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "You still can.",
      "start": 31.04,
      "end": 32.42,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Just don't go alone.",
      "start": 32.78,
      "end": 33.84,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Say, want to go ask him about that hiring bit together?",
      "start": 34.28,
      "end": 36.92,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Two people with one sharp question get more than forty seconds.",
      "start": 37.34,
      "end": 40.66,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "He'll remember the pair who listened.",
      "start": 41.3,
      "end": 42.62,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "You walked in to meet the speaker.",
      "start": 43.44,
      "end": 44.74,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "You walked out with a speaker who knows you, and someone to go to the next one with.",
      "start": 45.4,
      "end": 49.28,
      "matched": "18/18"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "Send this to the friend who sprints to the stage before the clapping stops.",
      "start": 49.68,
      "end": 53.02,
      "matched": "14/14"
    }
  ],
